#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""didacta -- teaching-content platform.

    didacta status                       what is in this repository
    didacta profiles                     the output profiles available
    didacta units [--lang va]            the content library
    didacta build <document>             every default output
    didacta build <document> -p slides   one output
    didacta build --all                  the whole repository
    didacta preview <unit>               compile one unit on its own
    didacta translations                 what needs translating
    didacta check                        validate the repository
    didacta new unit <path>              scaffold a unit
    didacta new year <course> <year>     duplicate the previous year
    didacta index                        generate the derived catalogues
    didacta tidy                         strip the migration header from the sources
    didacta migrate <legacy> <target>    import from the legacy system

Run from anywhere inside a content repository; the root is found by walking up
for didacta.yaml.
"""

